# Default flags for act (https://github.com/nektos/act).
#
# The stock act image has no Go toolchain, so use catthehacker's runner image,
# which is what most GitHub-hosted-runner workflows expect.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest

# On Apple silicon, uncomment this if an action ships amd64-only binaries.
# Everything in this repository runs natively on arm64, and emulation is slow.
# --container-architecture linux/amd64
